M73 P0 R28
M73 Q0 S29
M201 X4000 Y4000 Z200 E2500 ; sets maximum accelerations, mm/sec^2
M203 X300 Y300 Z12 E120 ; sets maximum feedrates, mm / sec
M204 P4000 R1250 T4000 ; sets acceleration (P, T) and retract acceleration (R), mm/sec^2
M205 X8.00 Y8.00 Z2.00 E5.00 ; sets the jerk limits, mm/sec
M205 S0 T0 ; sets the minimum extruding and travel feed rate, mm/sec

M486 S0
M486 Abottom_v6-Body
M486 S-1

;TYPE:Custom
M17 ; enable steppers
M862.1 P0.4 A0 F0 ; nozzle check
M862.3 P "MK3.5" ; printer model check
M862.5 P2 ; g-code level check
M862.6 P"Input shaper" ; FW feature check
M115 U6.1.3+7898

M555 X80.1729 Y87.6729 W89.6543 H30.6543

G90 ; use absolute coordinates
M83 ; extruder relative mode

M140 S85 ; set bed temp
M104 T0 S170 ; set extruder temp for bed leveling
M109 T0 R170 ; wait for temp
M190 S85 ; wait for bed temp

G28 ; home all

G29 P1 ; invalidate mbl & probe print area
G29 P1 X23 Y5 W80 H20 C ; probe near purge place
G29 P3.2 ; interpolate mbl probes
G29 P3.13 ; extrapolate mbl outside probe area
G29 A ; activate mbl

; prepare for purge
M104 S230
G0 X0 Y-4 Z15 F4800 ; move away and ready for the purge
M109 S230

; Extrude purge line

G92 E0 ; reset extruder position
G0 E7 X15 Z0.2 F500 ; purge
G0 X25 E4 F500 ; purge
G0 X35 E4 F650 ; purge
G0 X45 E4 F800 ; purge
G0 X48 Z0.05 F8000 ; wipe, move close to the bed
G0 X51 Z0.2 F8000 ; wipe, move quickly away from the bed

G92 E0
M221 S100 ; reset flow to 100%
G21 ; set units to millimeters
G90 ; use absolute coordinates
M83 ; use relative distances for extrusion





